      "title": "Inflation erased the income gain.",
      "dek": "New federal figures show inflation absorbed the gain in after-tax income.",
      "script": "A new report shows inflation swallowed Americans' income gains. The Bureau of Economic Analysis said Wednesday that after-tax income rose in August. Prices rose too, leaving buying power flat. Annual inflation was three point four percent, above the Fed's two percent goal. The next test: can income start outpacing prices? That's what gives households more room to breathe.",
